{
  "$comment": "#EXP-2024: the pinned live view of an agent's space on this machine (f5-f6-design.md section 6 on #EXP-1514). A press on a row of the taskbar's Agent spaces list pins its session's view (ONE at a time, by session: it follows a session whose space is made anew): this on-demand top layer at the bottom right of the first display, above the taskbar, that never takes the keyboard (no `keyboard` key: none) when it maps, is pressed, resized or closed. The header: the session's title (`Agent space n` without one), the size button (only where twice the size fits: ede_space {session, size: large | default}) and Close (ede_space {session: null}); under it the space as the shell's capture loop pictures it (/spaceView/picture, at the display's scale; Image's fallback after 5 s of failed captures). The shell sizes the layer from packages/uicore/fixtures/spaces.json (640 or a third of the display wide, the space's aspect). View only: a click reaches the view's buttons, never the space; it shows no pointer; it covers its corner and takes its clicks until it is closed; captures of the person's screen show it black.",
  "surface": {
    "layer": "top",
    "anchor": [
      "bottom",
      "right"
    ],
    "size": {
      "width": 642,
      "height": 442
    },
    "margin": {
      "right": 10,
      "bottom": 10
    },
    "onDemand": true,
    "functions": [
      "ede_space"
    ]
  },
  "root": {
    "id": "space_view",
    "component": "Box",
    "style": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "backgroundColor": "$color.popover",
      "borderWidth": 1,
      "borderColor": "$color.border",
      "borderRadius": "$radius.lg",
      "overflow": "hidden"
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "space_view_head",
        "component": "Stack",
        "props": {
          "direction": "horizontal",
          "gap": "xs",
          "align": "center"
        },
        "style": {
          "height": 40,
          "paddingLeft": "$spacing.sm",
          "paddingRight": "$spacing.xs",
          "flexShrink": 0
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "id": "space_view_title",
            "component": "Text",
            "props": {
              "text": {
                "@path": "/spaceView/title"
              },
              "lines": 1
            },
            "style": {
              "flexGrow": 1,
              "minWidth": 0
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "space_view_size",
            "component": "Button",
            "props": {
              "icon": {
                "@call": "cond",
                "args": {
                  "if": {
                    "@path": "/spaceView/large"
                  },
                  "then": "ui-fullscreen-exit",
                  "else": "ui-fullscreen"
                }
              },
              "variant": "ghost",
              "size": "icon",
              "label": {
                "@call": "cond",
                "args": {
                  "if": {
                    "@path": "/spaceView/large"
                  },
                  "then": "Smaller",
                  "else": "Larger"
                }
              }
            },
            "visible": {
              "@call": "cond",
              "args": {
                "if": {
                  "@path": "/spaceView/canGrow"
                },
                "then": true,
                "else": false
              }
            },
            "on": {
              "press": {
                "functionCall": {
                  "@call": "ede_space",
                  "args": {
                    "session": {
                      "@path": "/spaceView/session"
                    },
                    "size": {
                      "@call": "cond",
                      "args": {
                        "if": {
                          "@path": "/spaceView/large"
                        },
                        "then": "default",
                        "else": "large"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "space_view_close",
            "component": "Button",
            "props": {
              "icon": "ui-close",
              "variant": "ghost",
              "size": "icon",
              "label": "Close"
            },
            "on": {
              "press": {
                "functionCall": {
                  "@call": "ede_space",
                  "args": {
                    "session": null
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "space_view_picture",
        "component": "Image",
        "props": {
          "src": {
            "@path": "/spaceView/picture"
          },
          "alt": {
            "@path": "/spaceView/title"
          },
          "fit": "contain",
          "fallback": "nav-computer"
        },
        "style": {
          "flexGrow": 1,
          "flexShrink": 1,
          "flexBasis": 0,
          "minHeight": 0,
          "width": "100%"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "data": {
    "spaceView": {
      "open": false,
      "session": null,
      "title": "",
      "picture": "",
      "large": false,
      "canGrow": false
    }
  }
}
